{
  "name": "AI Cold Email Outreach",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📧 AI Cold Email Outreach — Setup\n1. **Google Sheet** with a tab named `Leads` and columns:\n`business_name, first_name, email, website, industry, city, status, sent_at, subject`\nLeave `status` empty for leads you want to email.\n2. Put your Sheet ID into **Get Leads** and **Mark as Sent**, connect Google Sheets credentials.\n3. **Settings** node: your name, company, pitch, sending email and AI model.\n4. **Write Email with AI**: add a Header Auth credential for Groq — name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_GROQ_API_KEY`.\n5. **Send Email**: add SMTP credential (use a separate, warmed-up outreach domain).\n6. Test with 2-3 rows of your OWN emails first, then activate.\n\nSends max 10/day (change in **Daily Limit**), weekdays 10:00, with 1-3 min gaps.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "2c6fc516-7497-4d71-9cb6-ade6d52541ea",
      "name": "Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
